{
	"name": "Withdraw",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/commodities/biological/shell-ribbed-grey.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, you may withdraw your limbs and head into your shell. While withdrawn you cannot move or take actions and are considered to be blinded, but gain a +2 bonus to your AC and resistance to nonmagical piercing and slashing damage. You may remain withdrawn for a number of rounds equal to your Constitution modifier, though you may choose to emerge from your shell before the duration is up as a bonus action. You may use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.</p>",
